  "question": {
    "text": "A straight line through a fixed point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;intersects the coordinate axes at distinct points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;is the origin and the rectangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is completed, then the locus of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "UwE76",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zQlJc",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rU9q4",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bR9BJ",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fe08edd9-9a9d-42ba-bf47-448f8138b924-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 224px;\" /></p><p>Let the equation of line be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Clearly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Also <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, locus is <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
